  {
    "id": 1013003030120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………確かに\r\nアナタの言うとおりかもしれないわ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いつもユニットでダンスレッスンしている動画だと\r\nなんていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……もっと楽しそうに見えるのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "どうして…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分でも意識しないうちに、\r\n肩に力が入ってるのかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……夏葉にとってそういう力を抜いてくれるのが、\r\n『放課後クライマックスガールズ』なのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間夏葉が言っていたとおりでさ\r\n『放課後クライマックスガールズ』は……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "２８３プロに所属することになった、\r\nそれまで面識のない５人──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それも、年齢も性格も\r\nバラバラの５人が集まったユニットだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも偶然っていうにはできすぎなくらい\r\n色んなことがぴったりハマった５人だと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、そうね\r\n……私もそう思うわ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お互いに補い合って、学びあって\r\nここまできたけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ユニットを離れている今だからこそ\r\n気が付くこともあるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ユニットとソロじゃ、\r\nダンスも歌も全然やり方が違うわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "どっちがいい、なんてことは無いし\r\n私はどっちも完璧にこなしたいけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ひとりのステージは\r\n驚くくらい広いし、少し寂しいわね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、ひとつだけ\r\n絶対変わらないものもあるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──ソロだろうとユニットだろうと、\r\n私がトップを目指すことには変わりない",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……いい報告をしなくちゃね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ねえ、プロデューサー\r\nこの後、自主レッスンに付き合ってちょうだい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300303/1013003030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003030250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "気が付いたことがあったら、なんでも教えてほしいの\r\n……全部完璧にしたいから！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
